{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年45歲的余文樂自今年7月宣布離婚後迅速重整旗鼓，僅相隔一個月便加入內地綜藝《披荊斬棘2026》，成為節目中唯一的香港代表。</p><p>近日，他罕有作客張泉靈主持的訪談節目《背後2》，在鏡頭前徹底卸下昔日「臭臉」防備，首度剖白多年來受嚴重身心疾病困擾</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T05:43:50.489299+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T05:15:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T05:37:13.226726+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T05:37:13.226726+00:00","content_hash":"76248ffc659fdc01437f0ab9eb2834c3d5bb45da1be420c6e28c7adea7916bc1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}